MARRIAGE FEUD —
"DON'T SAY IT'S RIDICULOUS!"

00:22:54.445 --> 00:23:00.611
Seiza—tachiga kirameite. ..
hizuke o kaeru

00:23:02.186 --> 00:23:08.489
Yosoyuki—gao ga ko cha ni...
sotto tokeru no

00:23:08.859 --> 00:23:16.994
Tada no watashi ni...
modoru shunkan

00:23:17.701 --> 00:23:22.866
Mada mada ima
wa nemuresou ni nai...

00:23:24.275 --> 00:23:27.301
Totsuzen—sugiru. ..

00:23:28.112 --> 00:23:31.980
Atarashii tokimeki ni

00:23:37.187 --> 00:23:39.621
Okashi—na kimochi yo

00:23:39.757 --> 00:23:47.391
Tatta hitori no...
dareka ni kawatteyuku...

00:23:47.965 --> 00:23:54.962
Sonna yokan. ..
dakishimeteitai. ..

00:23:55.572 --> 00:23:59.133
Nemuru made...
